# This file keeps the empty scripts/ directory in git.
#
# Purpose of scripts/:
#   Standalone helper scripts that are NOT part of the installed `mdtk`
#   command — e.g. dev tooling, one-off generators, maintenance scripts.
#   Anything that is source code belonging to the toolkit itself belongs
#   under src/ instead.
#
# (Replaced by real scripts as needed. Delete this file once the first
# real script lands here.)
